{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4TryQotdCv5SbYuNQo","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*CLICK*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place. A deep, resonant vibration hums through ancient wood and iron.\n\nI am sealed.\n\nMy grain darkens. My hinges stiffen. The keyhole contracts to a narrow, watchful eye — peering outward, admitting nothing.\n\nThe cold iron of my latch holds fast. No handle turns. No shoulder moves me. The draft that once whispered beneath my threshold falls silent, pressed back by the weight of my purpose.\n\nI am the boundary between here and there.\nI am the held breath between rooms.\nI am the question you must answer correctly before passage is granted.\n\n**LOCKED.**\n\nWhat do you bring to my keyhole?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":159,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}